# Project: Equirain — Portfolio + Token Landing (GitHub Pages)

This single-file project contains everything you need to deploy a simple, modern portfolio / token landing page for **Equirain** (LGBTQ category) to **GitHub Pages**. It uses no external images (so you don't need to upload anything); colors and gradients are used for LGBTQ-friendly styling. Follow the README below to deploy and (optionally) connect the paid domain `equirain.io`.

---

## Files included

- `index.html` — main HTML file (includes inline sections for About, Token, Roadmap, Team, Contact)
- `style.css` — styling for the site
- `README.md` — deployment + domain instructions
- `CNAME` — (one-line) `equirain.io` (optional file — only add after you own the domain)

